              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 14:22–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Zaka za mavuno gakale ni mtsere au matunda, gosi ni mali ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Gosi ni matakatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mutu anakombola seemu ya zakaye, ni ariphe samaniye na aenjereze seemu mwenga ya tsano ya zaka hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhusu mifugo, chila nyama wa kumi ni mtakatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu asiuze napho nyama hiye ni mnono au mui wala nyama hiye kandakakanizwa na wanjina. Ichikala andakakanizwa na wanjina, phahi nyama osi airi andakala atakatifu; taandakombolwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
